WEBVTT

00:12:56.663 --> 00:13:00.663
This is especially true
for dragon parents.

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:05.397
The author, Emily Rapp,
came up with this term

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:09.363
after her baby was diagnosed
with Tay-Sachs disease.

00:13:10.763 --> 00:13:14.997
She knew then that Ronan
would never walk or talk.

00:13:15.630 --> 00:13:18.297
He would likely die before turning four.

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:24.297
I did not know

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:28.197
that this could also be the fate
of my firstborn son.